  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Providing immediate user-feedback when a fixity algorithm is not supported by the server would be helpful... both in the cases where the \"Digest\" header is provided on-ingest, and when an alternate default algorithm is provided (as described in this ticket). See: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#binary-fixity"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#binary-fixity",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See also: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2297?focusedCommentId=54133&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-54133"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2297?focusedCommentId=54133&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-54133",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
