  "description": "<p>Providing immediate user-feedback when a fixity algorithm is not supported by the server would be helpful... both in the cases where the \"Digest\" header is provided on-ingest, and when an alternate default algorithm is provided (as described in this ticket). See: <a href=\"http://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#binary-fixity\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#binary-fixity</a></p>\n\n<p>See also: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2297?focusedCommentId=54133&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-54133\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2297?focusedCommentId=54133&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-54133</a></p>",
